            <div xml:id="m-e3df4d36-fb39-4caf-9538-866bc59738f7">
              <lg xml:id="m-cc19eb33-dfcc-4475-a2e7-95b5cb3646a8">
                <l xml:id="m-b13f9b57-1f89-49e2-a8e4-ba10f395755f" facs="#m-83ba5318-2a3b-44ee-bd3f-912344207845" label="text-like">St. Stephen, The First Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-aa1e131f-fab0-4110-bc33-ae0720f676d3" facs="#m-409a7b4e-9afb-4821-a223-5de4c185a824" label="ambiguous">410</l><l xml:id="m-e373c1f8-e488-492d-ae8c-59f001c76e87" facs="#m-73a9eb25-6a7a-4ea0-b14b-d26eb6f94366" label="lyrics-like">a déxtris Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-bc69daa1-8651-4a7f-aaae-a37635de274e" facs="#m-d846a540-6be4-460e-9dd8-d57e8ebdf1c8" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-48eacea3-ec98-4b04-a5a8-fdd9ad3f6f1e" facs="#m-02c9bf67-718d-4ecd-a96e-0cd8e193c936" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-6ecb2710-25b2-4114-afae-90330a63b4df" facs="#m-3523237e-4ec3-43db-a800-99abf885943b" label="ambiguous">Acts 7. g.</l><l xml:id="m-aeddaa0b-efa4-4217-b4fb-c17b505506b5" facs="#m-4e54121a-0613-4671-a144-cc36a2a7f541" label="lyrics-like">DOsitis autem génibus clamávit! cum hoc dixisset, obdormívit in</l><l xml:id="m-f5fb0c27-3427-4d68-9ddd-0cb4a2b68a7d" facs="#m-93036af6-52bb-487e-a3ea-26351bf2cc72" label="lyrics-like">L voce magna, dicens: t Dómine</l><l xml:id="m-74828173-f329-4d4b-bc8e-c1065e2e535d" facs="#m-2e15aa39-621d-4603-b6bc-a055ef62eaa3" label="lyrics-like">Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-44ce9087-e40b-4f83-9dfd-38a3c8593e09" facs="#m-89866e1b-00a8-4c49-980d-dc4149046917" label="lyrics-like">ne státuas illis hoc peccátum. *Et</l><l xml:id="m-e4845ff4-b1ec-4039-b3d5-984dc6b33146" facs="#m-702bc71b-4bb3-456a-b205-eb089684074c" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Mágna est. V. Jústus. from the Common of a Martyr, p. 1125.</l><l xml:id="m-a4d0642d-a75d-4916-88df-814698b459df" facs="#m-501a9c72-7bc2-48e3-ba42-0e75b5e9454c" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-e253b8f6-53e9-4c6b-84cf-5636ad42c4eb" facs="#m-d03ed365-b258-4f7f-80cd-1ee9465ec2a5" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms from the Nativity, p. Hi. These Antiphons and</l><l xml:id="m-8b52a0a8-0201-4feb-9312-36546137e615" facs="#m-93f98509-beb8-4d0e-b8f8-57289c803fd1" label="lyrics-like">Psalms are said on all the Feasts which arẽ celebrated during the Octave ot</l><l xml:id="m-b3c4d177-a217-4a6d-80aa-06e781bf60da" facs="#m-18f1db79-2992-4ec3-88af-6c5441dac7d7" label="text-like">the Nativity.</l><l xml:id="m-ac1112bf-954d-42ea-9d69-a5bf1a2941f5" facs="#m-2237a0f5-0dcf-4225-b465-72a371156979" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-a7fc89e9-dbbc-450a-85b7-43cfbd42fb94" facs="#m-cf8480fe-accd-4cac-a042-4631836fe671" label="ambiguous">Acts 6. b.</l><l xml:id="m-695189d6-3a85-40ee-a78d-c105b40b5675" facs="#m-287b65b5-61c1-4406-9bdb-2e8f956d546e" label="lyrics-like">TTéphanus autem plenus grátia digia et signa magna in pópulo.</l><l xml:id="m-80519f59-0ff9-4648-bb03-05a57e528d7f" facs="#m-069272ef-3146-4f83-a04a-33917560e9b6" label="lyrics-like">O et fortitúdine, “ faciébat pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-6967deaf-3cec-4545-a980-14c2a002f6b0" facs="#m-48524324-b958-4ef2-bc10-89de207aa140" label="ambiguous">Hymn.E</l><l xml:id="m-73fdfc5a-99b3-469e-830a-2834e3f144cb" facs="#m-5c3c0af8-77bf-4d0a-a8e2-f7344b374319" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-eabb9c9c-1315-4ea9-89a1-bdff1ec92a28" facs="#m-162842a7-dea2-49ff-b084-ba16d1c021fb" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-be20898a-54cd-4e41-823d-2f46ef17b975" facs="#m-3c4a9e36-71a8-409d-9fd1-f5315c95d5c7" label="lyrics-like">E-us, tu-ó-rum mí-li-tum Sors et coróna, praémi¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3dc9aca-45d4-4599-9632-3f32d8d35d91" facs="#m-4a2ca05b-2d09-41c9-8a68-f7c030276e69" label="lyrics-like">um: Láudes canéntes Márty-ris Absólve néxu crimi¬</l><l xml:id="m-1046007f-04a5-48da-9003-62964111ac71" facs="#m-111a02b3-b40f-48ff-9ac8-460364149494" label="lyrics-like">nis. 2. Hic nempe múndi gáudi-a Et blánda fráudum pá¬</l><l xml:id="m-5d61ab6f-2d41-41f0-98ca-3fb89393c705" facs="#m-a3f4436f-e8bf-4c37-a511-24d6663861a2" label="lyrics-like">bu- la Imbúta félle députans, Pervénit ad cae-lésti-a.</l><l xml:id="m-15b78c7e-2090-4fad-8473-3053fd4a2921" facs="#m-631f4383-63ad-435e-8978-3a16334e4d5a" label="lyrics-like">3. Poénas cucúrrit fórti-ter, Et sústu-lit vi-rí-li- ter: Fun¬</l><l xml:id="m-3209d3d4-c4b3-4d78-87fa-36830ec75f7a" facs="#m-00cb4ba0-8276-419b-b8d5-d694c926c131" label="lyrics-like">dénsque pro te sánguinem, Aetérna dó-na póssidet. 4. Ob</l></lg>
